      "stem_html": "<p>Ljósgreining á <i>cis</i>-sýklóbútenhverfunni í dæmi 30-37 gefur <i>cis</i>-sýklódódekaen-7-ýn, en ljósgreining á trans-hverfunni gefur <i>trans</i>-sýklódódekaen-7-ýn. Útskýrðu þessar niðurstöður og tilgreindu gerð og staðefnafræði hringhverfa efnahvarfsins.</p>\n<img class=\"scaled-down\" src=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBZzhhIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--65323240bcf73c1c6939921eead0e2dbf9cb5f13/OChem_30_EC_023.jpg\" alt=\"Cis cyclobutene isomer undergoes a photochemical reaction to give cis-cyclododecaen-7-yne. The trans-isomer undergoes a photochemical reaction to give trans-cyclododecaen-7-yne. A double bond is between C 1 and C 2.\">",
